<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <title>Tablero de acciones · avanzado</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#edf1f7;
      --panel:#ffffff;
      --panel-soft:#f7f9fc;
      --text:#1f2a44;
      --muted:#6a7895;
      --line:#cfd7e5;
      --line-soft:#e4e9f2;
      --shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(26,40,71,.08);
      --col-width:255px;
      --radius:8px;
      --card-radius:6px;
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
    body{
      font-family:"Montserrat", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.86), rgba(243,246,250,.96)),
        var(--bg);
      color:var(--text);
      min-height:100vh;
    }

    .compact{
      --col-width:228px;
      --radius:6px;
      --card-radius:5px;
    }

    .app{
      max-width:1900px;
      margin:auto;
      padding:14px;
    }

    .panel{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.82);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
    }

    header{
      position:sticky;
      top:10px;
      z-index:60;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      gap:16px;
      padding:15px;
      border-radius:14px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .brand{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      min-width:260px;
    }

    .logo{
      width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;
      display:grid;place-items:center;
      color:#fff;font-size:21px;font-weight:900;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#457cff,#7a60ff);
    }

    h1{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2vw,1.45rem);
      line-height:1.15;
    }
    .sub{
      margin-top:4px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.88rem;
    }

    .toolbar{
      display:flex;
      gap:8px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      justify-content:flex-end;
    }

    button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}

    .btn{
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      background:#fff;
      color:var(--text);
      border-radius:10px;
      padding:9px 12px;
      cursor:pointer;
      transition:.15s ease;
      white-space:nowrap;
    }
    .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px); background:#f4f7fd}
    .btn.primary{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4c7dff,#7b61ff);
      color:#fff;
      border-color:transparent;
    }
    .btn.active{
      outline:2px solid #b9cbff;
      background:#eef4ff;
    }

    .stats{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(5, minmax(130px,1fr));
      gap:10px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .stat{
      border-radius:12px;
      padding:13px 14px;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      gap:8px;
    }
    .stat strong{display:block;font-size:1.35rem;line-height:1}
    .stat small{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:var(--muted)}
    .badge{
      padding:5px 8px;
      border-radius:999px;
      font-size:.74rem;
      font-weight:800;
      border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08);
      background:#f1f5fb;
      white-space:nowrap;
    }

    .meta-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
      gap:12px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .legend,.filters{
      padding:14px;
      border-radius:12px;
    }

    .legend h3,.filters h3{
      margin:0 0 10px;
      font-size:.94rem;
    }

    .legend-list{
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:8px;
    }

    .legend-chip{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:8px;
      padding:7px 9px;
      border-radius:9px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      background:#fff;
      font-size:.82rem;
    }

    .swatch{
      width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08)
    }

    .filters-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:minmax(230px,1.4fr) 180px 180px 180px 180px auto;
      gap:10px;
    }

    .field{
      width:100%;
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      color:var(--text);
      border-radius:9px;
      padding:10px 11px;
      outline:none;
    }
    .field::placeholder{color:#8f9cb9}
    select.field option{color:#111}

    .alertbar{
      display:none;
      border-radius:12px;
      padding:11px 13px;
      background:#fff2f2;
      border:1px solid #e4b7b7;
      color:#7b2f2f;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    .alertbar.show{display:block}


    .top-scroll-wrap{
      position:sticky;
      top:92px;
      z-index:45;
      padding:6px 10px 4px;
      border-radius:12px;
      margin-bottom:8px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(26,40,71,.06);
    }
    .top-scroll{
      width:100%;
      height:16px;
      overflow-x:auto;
      overflow-y:hidden;
    }
    .top-scroll-inner{height:1px}
    .top-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar{height:12px}
    .top-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#b9c5da;border-radius:999px}
    .lucide-col svg,.logo svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke-width:2}
    .tag svg,.attachment-item svg,.attachment-edit-item svg{width:13px;height:13px;vertical-align:-2px}

    .sheet-shell{
      border-radius:14px;
      padding:10px;
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .board{
      display:grid;
      grid-auto-flow:column;
      grid-auto-columns:minmax(var(--col-width),var(--col-width));
      gap:8px;
      overflow-x:auto;
      align-items:start;
      padding-bottom:6px;
      min-height:60vh;
    }
    .board::-webkit-scrollbar{height:12px}
    .board::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#c7d1e4;border-radius:999px}

    .column{
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      overflow:hidden;
      background:#fff;
    }

    .column.collapsed .column-body{display:none}

    .col-head{
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .col-main{
      min-height:48px;
      padding:9px 10px;
      display:flex;
      align-items:flex-start;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:8px;
      color:#fff;
      font-weight:800;
      font-size:.84rem;
      line-height:1.2;
    }
    .compact .col-main{font-size:.8rem;min-height:44px;padding:8px 9px}

    .col-left{
      display:flex;
      gap:8px;
      min-width:0;
      flex:1;
      align-items:flex-start;
    }
    .col-title{min-width:0}
    .col-title-text{
      display:block;
      word-break:break-word;
    }
    .count{
      margin-top:3px;
      color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);
      font-size:.72rem;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .collapse{
      width:26px;height:26px;
      border-radius:7px;border:none;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);
      color:#fff;cursor:pointer;flex:0 0 auto
    }

    .column-body{
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.98), rgba(249,251,255,.98));
      padding:8px;
    }

    .quick-add{
      display:flex;
      gap:7px;
      margin-bottom:8px;
    }
    .compact .quick-add .field{padding:8px 10px}
    .compact .quick-add .btn{padding:8px 10px}

    .task-list{
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:7px;
    }

    .task{
      position:relative;
      border-radius:var(--card-radius);
      border:1px solid #d8dfeb;
      background:#f3f6fb;
      padding:8px;
      box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.65) inset;
    }
    .compact .task{padding:7px}

    .task::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      left:0;top:0;bottom:0;
      width:4px;
      border-top-left-radius:var(--card-radius);
      border-bottom-left-radius:var(--card-radius);
      background:var(--accent, #8ca2d8);
    }

    .task.overdue{
      box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d98b8b inset;
    }

    .task-top{
      display:flex;
      gap:8px;
      align-items:flex-start;
    }

    .check{
      width:16px;height:16px;
      margin-top:2px;
      accent-color:#47c87c;
      cursor:pointer;
      flex:0 0 auto;
    }

    .task-main{flex:1;min-width:0}

    .task-title{
      font-weight:800;
      font-size:.88rem;
      line-height:1.32;
      word-break:break-word;
    }
    .compact .task-title{font-size:.83rem}
    .task.done .task-title{text-decoration:line-through}

    .task-desc{
      margin-top:4px;
      color:#4b5873;
      font-size:.8rem;
      line-height:1.36;
      white-space:pre-wrap;
    }

    .task-tags{
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      gap:5px;
      margin-top:8px;
    }

    .tag{
      font-size:.68rem;
      padding:4px 7px;
      border-radius:999px;
      border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.07);
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.6);
      color:#33425f;
    }
    .status-chip{
      font-weight:800;
    }

    .attachment-list{
      margin-top:8px;
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:5px;
    }
    .attachment-item{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:7px;
      padding:5px 7px;
      border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.07);
      border-radius:8px;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);
      font-size:.76rem;
      color:#364462;
    }
    .attachment-item a{
      color:#365ecf;
      text-decoration:none;
      overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;
      flex:1;
    }

    .task-actions{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:flex-end;
      gap:5px;
      margin-top:8px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }
    .mini{
      border:none;
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.58);
      color:#3d4963;
      border-radius:7px;
      padding:4px 7px;
      cursor:pointer;
      font-size:.78rem;
    }
    .mini:hover{background:#fff}

    .column-footer{padding-top:8px}
    .column-footer .btn{width:100%}

    .empty{
      padding:16px 10px;
      text-align:center;
      font-size:.83rem;
      color:var(--muted);
      border:1px dashed var(--line);
      border-radius:6px;
      background:#fff;
    }

    dialog{
      width:min(840px, calc(100% - 24px));
      border:none;
      border-radius:16px;
      padding:0;
      background:#fff;
      color:var(--text);
      box-shadow:0 26px 62px rgba(18,30,53,.22);
    }
    dialog::backdrop{
      background:rgba(18,29,49,.34);
      backdrop-filter:blur(3px);
    }

    .modal{
      padding:20px;
    }
    .modal h3{margin:0 0 14px}

    .grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
      gap:12px;
    }
    .full{grid-column:1/-1}
    label{
      display:block;
      font-size:.84rem;
      color:var(--muted);
      margin-bottom:6px;
    }
    textarea.field{min-height:88px;resize:vertical}

    .hint{
      margin-top:6px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:.78rem;
      line-height:1.35;
    }


    .category-preview{
      margin-top:8px;
      padding:9px 10px;
      border-radius:9px;
      border:1px solid #bfd0f2;
      background:#f1f6ff;
      color:#25416f;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:10px;
      font-size:.8rem;
    }
    .category-preview[hidden]{display:none}
    .category-preview-label{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
    .category-preview strong{font-weight:800;text-align:right}

    .attachment-edit-list{
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:6px;
      margin-top:8px;
    }
    .attachment-edit-item{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      gap:8px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      background:#fafcff;
      border-radius:8px;
      padding:7px 8px;
      font-size:.82rem;
    }

    .modal-actions{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:flex-end;
      gap:8px;
      margin-top:16px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .config-section{
      border:1px solid var(--line-soft);
      border-radius:10px;
      padding:12px;
      background:#fafcff;
      margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    .config-section h4{
      margin:0 0 10px;
      font-size:.9rem;
    }
    .status-config-list,.substatus-config-list{
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:8px;
    }
    .config-row{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:1.2fr 110px 90px auto;
      gap:8px;
      align-items:center;
    }
    .config-row.sub{
      grid-template-columns:1fr auto;
    }

    .toast-wrap{
      position:fixed;
      right:14px;
      bottom:14px;
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:8px;
      z-index:90;
    }
    .toast{
      max-width:360px;
      padding:10px 12px;
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius:10px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }

    @media (max-width:1180px){
      header{position:static;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
      .toolbar{justify-content:flex-start}
      .stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
      .meta-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .filters-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
      .filters-grid > :first-child{grid-column:1/-1}
      .board{display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:visible}
      .column{width:100%}
    }

    @media (max-width:700px){
      .app{padding:10px}
      .toolbar{width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
      .toolbar .btn{width:100%}
      .filters-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .full{grid-column:auto}
      .quick-add{flex-direction:column}
      .config-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .config-row.sub{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app" id="app">
    <header class="panel">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo"><i data-lucide="layout-dashboard"></i></div>
        <div>
          <h1>Tablero de acciones</h1>
          <div class="sub">Más columnas en vista simple, colores suaves según la lógica de tu captura: verde realizado, amarillo en proceso y rojo urgente</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <button class="btn" id="pendingBtn"><i data-lucide="list-filter"></i> Solo no realizadas</button>
        <button class="btn" id="compactBtn"><i data-lucide="columns-3"></i> Vista compacta</button>
        <button class="btn" id="collapseBtn"><i data-lucide="minimize-2"></i> Contraer todo</button>
        <button class="btn" id="configBtn"><i data-lucide="tags"></i> Etiquetas y colores</button>
        <button class="btn" id="integrationBtn"><i data-lucide="bell-ring"></i> Recordatorios</button>
        <button class="btn primary" id="newTaskBtn"><i data-lucide="plus"></i> Nueva tarea</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="stats">
      <div class="stat panel"><div><strong id="statTotal">0</strong><small>Total</small></div><span class="badge">Tablero</span></div>
      <div class="stat panel"><div><strong id="statPending">0</strong><small>Urgentes</small></div><span class="badge" id="badgePending">Urgente</span></div>
      <div class="stat panel"><div><strong id="statProgress">0</strong><small>En proceso</small></div><span class="badge" id="badgeProgress">Proceso</span></div>
      <div class="stat panel"><div><strong id="statDone">0</strong><small>Completadas</small></div><span class="badge" id="badgeDone">Hecha</span></div>
      <div class="stat panel"><div><strong id="statDue">0</strong><small>Vencidas / hoy</small></div><span class="badge" style="background:#fff1f1;border-color:#e4b7b7">Alerta</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="meta-grid">
      <div class="filters panel" style="grid-column:1/-1">
        <h3>Filtros</h3>
        <div class="filters-grid">
          <input id="searchInput" class="field" placeholder="Buscar tarea, responsable o descripción..." />
          <select id="areaFilter" class="field"><option value="">Todas las categorías</option></select>
          <select id="statusFilter" class="field"><option value="">Todos los estados</option></select>
          <select id="substatusFilter" class="field"><option value="">Todos los subestados</option></select>
          <select id="deadlineFilter" class="field">
            <option value="">Todos los plazos</option>
            <option value="overdue">Vencidas</option>
            <option value="today">Vencen hoy</option>
            <option value="week">Próximos 7 días</option>
            <option value="none">Sin plazo</option>
          </select>
          <button class="btn" id="clearFiltersBtn">Limpiar</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="alertBar" class="alertbar"></section>

    <div class="top-scroll-wrap" id="topScrollWrap"><div class="top-scroll" id="topScroll"><div class="top-scroll-inner" id="topScrollInner"></div></div></div>

    <section class="sheet-shell panel">
      <main id="board" class="board"></main>
    </section>
  </div>

  <dialog id="taskDialog">
    <form id="taskForm" class="modal">
      <h3 id="taskDialogTitle">Nueva tarea</h3>
      <input type="hidden" id="taskId" />
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="full">
          <label for="taskTitle">Título</label>
          <input id="taskTitle" class="field" required placeholder="Ej.: Ver resultados y preparar informe..." />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="taskArea">Categoría / columna</label>
          <select id="categoryMode" class="field" style="margin-bottom:8px">
            <option value="manual">Elegir categoría manualmente</option>
            <option value="auto">Detectar categoría automáticamente</option>
          </select>
          <input id="taskArea" class="field" list="areaList" required placeholder="Ej.: Inscripciones" />
          <datalist id="areaList"></datalist>
          <div class="hint" id="categoryDetectionHint">La detección usa el título, la descripción y el subestado.</div>
          <div id="categoryPreview" class="category-preview" hidden>
            <span class="category-preview-label">Categoría detectada</span>
            <strong id="categoryPreviewValue"></strong>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="taskOwner">Responsable</label>
          <input id="taskOwner" class="field" placeholder="Ej.: Lucas" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="taskDeadline">Fecha límite</label>
          <input id="taskDeadline" class="field" type="date" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="taskStatus">Estado</label>
          <select id="taskStatus" class="field"></select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="taskSubstatus">Subestado</label>
          <input id="taskSubstatus" class="field" list="substatusList" placeholder="Ej.: Esperando respuesta" />
          <datalist id="substatusList"></datalist>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="taskPriority">Prioridad</label>
          <select id="taskPriority" class="field">
            <option value="alta">Alta</option>
            <option value="media">Media</option>
            <option value="baja">Baja</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="full">
          <label for="taskDescription">Descripción</label>
          <textarea id="taskDescription" class="field" placeholder="Detalle, notas o próximos pasos..."></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="full">
          <label for="taskAttachments">Adjuntos</label>
          <input id="taskAttachments" class="field" type="file" multiple />
          <div class="hint">Ideal para adjuntos livianos. Se guardan dentro del navegador.</div>
          <div class="attachment-edit-list" id="attachmentEditList"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="modal-actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('taskDialog').close()">Cancelar</button>
        <button type="submit" class="btn primary">Guardar tarea</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </dialog>

  <dialog id="configDialog">
    <form id="configForm" class="modal">
      <h3>Configurar etiquetas, estados, colores y subestados</h3>

      <div class="config-section">
        <h4>Estados</h4>
        <div class="hint">Por defecto: rojo = urgente y no hecha, amarillo = en proceso, verde = realizada. Podés cambiar nombres y colores. El identificador se usa internamente.</div>
        <div class="status-config-list" id="statusConfigList"></div>
        <div class="modal-actions" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:10px">
          <button type="button" class="btn" id="addStatusBtn">+ Agregar estado</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="config-section">
        <h4>Subestados sugeridos</h4>
        <div class="hint">Estas opciones aparecen como sugerencias en el formulario de tareas, pero igualmente podés escribir uno nuevo manualmente.</div>
        <div class="substatus-config-list" id="substatusConfigList"></div>
        <div class="modal-actions" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:10px">
          <button type="button" class="btn" id="addSubstatusBtn">+ Agregar subestado</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="modal-actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('configDialog').close()">Cancelar</button>
        <button type="submit" class="btn primary">Guardar configuración</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </dialog>


  <dialog id="integrationDialog">
